---
layout: layouts/base.njk
tone: navy
title: "Events"
description: "Festivals, theme weeks and trips at Palm River Academy, and what students did at each: performing, hosting, running stalls and leading activities for younger classes."
permalink: /events/
---
{# This school year's events, newest first (Bowen, 2026-10-16). Past years have a page each,
   /events/<year>/ from src/events/past.njk. Which year is "this year" comes from src/_data/eventYears.js. #}
{% set heroPhoto = "events-hero-maths-prize-stickers" %}
{% set heroShape = "tall" %}
{% set heroEyebrow = "Events" %}
{% set heroTitle = 'Our students <span class="mark">run the show</span>' %}
{% set heroText = "Festivals, theme weeks and trips. At each one, students perform, host, run stalls or lead activities for younger classes. This year's events are added as they happen, newest first." %}
{% include "partials/pagehero.njk" %}

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="gallery__hint events__hint" hidden>Tap a photo to see it bigger.</p>
    {% set sy = eventYears.current %}{% set evNewest = true %}
    {% set evTitle = sy + " <span>This year</span>" %}
    {% set evMonths = "Jump to a month" %}{% set evDid = "What students did" %}{% set evMore = "The full story" %}
    {% include "partials/events-year.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>

{% set waveColor = "pale" %}{% include "partials/wave.njk" %}
<section class="band--pale">
  <div class="wrap center narrow">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--blue">Last year</p>
    <h2>Events from {{ eventYears.past[0] }}</h2>
    <p class="lede">Mid-Autumn, Christmas, Tết, March Mathness, graduation and more, with what students did at each.</p>
    <p class="event-page__links">
      {% for y in eventYears.past %}<a class="btn {{ 'btn--primary' if loop.first else 'btn--ghost' }}" href="{{ ('/events/' + y + '/') | href(lang) }}">{{ y }} events</a>{% endfor %}
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
{% set waveColor = "white" %}{% include "partials/wave.njk" %}

<section>
  <div class="wrap center narrow">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--blue">This year</p>
    <h2>Dates for {{ eventYears.current }}</h2>
    <p class="lede">Term dates and holidays are on the calendar. We send event dates to families during the year.</p>
    <a class="btn btn--primary" href="{{ '/families/schedule/#calendar' | href(lang) }}">See the calendar</a>
  </div>
</section>

{% set waveColor = "blue" %}{% include "partials/wave.njk" %}
{% include "partials/cta.njk" %}
